# Flint is devnet-only (FLINT_BUILD_CONTEXT.md Sections 6.3 / 12).
# Nothing here should ever contain a mainnet key or point at mainnet.

# --- Rust / Anchor build output ---
target/
.anchor/
test-ledger/
*.so

# --- Node / Next.js ---
node_modules/
.next/
out/
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Secrets ---
# env files and keypairs never get committed (devnet-only, but still)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*-keypair.json
id.json
programs/*/target/deploy/*-keypair.json

# --- Editor / OS / logs ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
